    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d740">

                <pb facs="0783" n="771" xml:id="pg771"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.796/773: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-02-05T00:00:00-05:00">February 5,
                        1942—midnight</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>292. Your 348, February 4, 8 p.m. You are authorized to make a commitment for the
                    purchase of the Lati planes at a reasonable price upon their being requisitioned
                    by the Brazilian Government, which it is hoped will be done immediately.</p>
                <p>The D. S. C. is cabling appropriate authority to Harding to arrange for the
                    purchase of the planes.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
